            into the scope in which it’s first encountered.
          %h2#references References
          %p These algorithmic rules are loosely based on:
          %ul
            %li#Allais
              Guillaume Allais,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Typing with Leftovers – A mechanization of Intuitionistic Multiplicative-Additive Linear Logic
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://drops.dagstuhl.de/opus/volltexte/2018/10049/pdf/LIPIcs-TYPES-2017-1.pdf"} pdf
          %p The idea to allow tensor projections in some sound way, and a lot of the notation, are from:
          %ul
            %li#Shulman
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michael+Shulman"}> Michael Shulman
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em A practical type theory for symmetric monoidal categories
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.00818"} arXiv
